# The working tree is ~13 GB. Almost all of it is regenerable: datasets,
# model weights, and rendered frames. What gets pushed is the code, the
# documents, the scene scripts, and the three showcase videos.

# ---- environments and caches ----
.venv-soup/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- vendored third-party source (clone it separately) ----
tools/Soup/

# ---- datasets (~2.3 GB, rebuildable from the build scripts) ----
datasets/
model/data/
svg/data/

# ---- model weights: single files exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit ----
# Provenance for every checkpoint is recorded in model/MODELS.md instead.
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
model/checkpoints/
model/scene_ckpt*/
model/checkpoint/
svg/checkpoint/

# ---- generated renders (~10 GB) ----
svg/out/
critic/out/
critic/tmp/

# Keep the showcase videos and comparison figures, drop the frame dumps.
out/*
!out/*.mp4
!out/a23_vs_a24_sheet.png

# ---- logs and archives ----
*.log
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ---- scratch inputs pulled from upstream projects ----
bus.jpg
zidane.jpg

# ---- private working notes, not for publication ----
ARXIV_SUBMISSION.md

# ---- old web demo: re-encoded third-party clips, unclear to redistribute ----
webapp/videos/
webapp/data.db

# ---- Hugging Face Space working copy (duplicates project files; lives on the Hub) ----
hf_space/
hf_space_progress.md
!out/2dvideogen_reel.mp4
